    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>Each affected creature gains one extra attack at its full base attack bonus whenever it makes a full attack. This is not an extra action and does not stack with similar extra-attack effects. It also gains +1 on attack rolls, +1 dodge AC, +1 Reflex, and +2 enhancement Strength.</p><p>Every movement mode increases by 30 feet, to no more than twice its normal speed; this is an enhancement bonus and increases jumping distance normally. Losing the Agility bonus to AC also removes the dodge bonus. <em>Cripple</em> counters and dispels this spell. The material component is a drop of blood mixed with earth.</p><p><strong>Automation boundary:</strong> Apply bonuses, movement caps, and the conditional extra attack manually; no automatic full-attack insertion or counterspell link is created.</p>"
    },
